WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.401
-Our next guest
is a writer, director,

00:00:02.401 --> 00:00:03.870
and "New York Times"
best-selling author

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.905
who you know from his work on
comedies such as "Trainwreck,"

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:08.207
"This is 40," and
"The King of Staten Island."

00:00:08.207 --> 00:00:10.243
