is streaming on Netflix.

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:17.717
Let's take a look.

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:20.420
-Um, a lot of you have been
asking about flirting.

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:21.754
Yes, it happens.

00:00:21.754 --> 00:00:24.323
Physical touch is,
of course, off the table.

00:00:24.323 --> 00:00:28.093
