making sweet eyes at each other.

00:00:28.093 --> 00:00:30.163
Um, if you're wondering
what that looks like,

00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:32.732
that would be...

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:34.667
[ Chuckles ]

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:38.104
[ Chuckles ]

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:39.305
Wh--

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:41.040
[ Chuckles ]

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.209
Oh.

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:44.677
Mm.

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:47.513
Are there any questions?

00:00:47.513 --> 00:00:50.416
Amazing.
Let's have some fun.

00:00:50.416 --> 00:00:51.784
-Please welcome back to the show

00:00:51.784 --> 00:00:54.320
our good friend Judd Apatow,
everybody!

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:56.322
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:56.322 --> 00:01:06.332 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:07.801 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:10.303
-Welcome back!
-It's so good to be here.

00:01:10.303 --> 00:01:11.671
-It's so great
to have you here in person.

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:13.606
