you'd take all the money."

00:02:59.479 --> 00:03:00.479
-Yeah.

00:03:00.479 --> 00:03:01.981
-And then it made
a lot of money.

00:03:01.981 --> 00:03:03.650
-Yeah.
-And then someone said to me,

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:05.551
