this one all goes to you."

00:03:26.806 --> 00:03:28.207
-Yeah. Exactly.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.207 --> 00:03:30.309
-So you were -- you definitely
cornered yourself, yeah.

00:03:30.309 --> 00:03:32.045
-Yes, I'm screwed for life
